{"id": "DF5dd4tJlYS", "title": "Video by vanessalau.co", "description": "Robert Frost famously said “The only way out, is through.”\n\nYou can’t ChatGPT your way out of a funk and into a reinvention. \n\nYes, it can provide clarity and some structure… but it really comes down to slowly taking it one step at a time, doing the things you’ve been avoiding, until you genuinely become the person you want to be. \n\nDepending on your follow through, your peers will then decide their perception of you because THEIR testimony will be your proof whether you actually walk the talk.\n\nPS: This is an excerpt from my full YouTube video titled:  “let’s talk about feeling trapped by a niche and how to get unstuck, creator to creator.”\n\nIf you’d like the link to the full video where I talk in depth about my experience of feeling boxed in as a creator and the steps I took to get unstuck…\n\nComment “YTARTIST” and I’ll DM you the link to the full video!", "channel": "vanessalau.co", "uploader_id": "1304307956", "uploader": "Vanessa Oi-Gwan Lau", "timestamp": 1739202610, "like_count": 989, "comment_count": 38, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1403345367515779a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.773, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOVxoFhUSMX6aUBUs2OGcgnfMerRKtTJLMCRl8pwTDiWlgyydCsdMCd7tWy8JUK74fuHqr_HZmIdELWlzCBAGOB.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=vodGoW-k22oQ7kNvwHtQuIG&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hQcW_K02lzvS4uhRe05vAA&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQL-thRzW5AKjeAZesjMETHQ8_TIGA3q_jMEnNOHAZV-8A&oe=6AA10E16", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 62.773, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) App